     "parts": [
      "1. **Individual prosumer:** $15/month (or $144/year), free during pilot. Comparable to what researchers already pay for writing/AI tools; you learn willingness to pay fast.\n2. **Lab seat bundle:** $500–1,000/lab/year for up to ~10 members, paid from discretionary/grant funds, with shared project spaces. Slower to sell, but a better fit if the value is in shared lab memory.\n\nFloat #1 as the starting point and #2 as where it could go. Say you'll test it in the October pilots."
